/S /P
/E (Senior team members introduced the freshers to the anatomy of a race car in a deep-dive session. The lecture covered all technical pillars dealing with Formula Student, from the engine and brakes to electrical systems, aerodynamics, and chassis. This session allowed freshers to understand the basics required to choose their path in Ashwa.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
